     The vviiaaeennvv driver was written by Johan Danielsson and ported to
     OpenBSD 3.4 by Alexander Yurchenko <_g_r_a_n_g_e_@_o_p_e_n_b_s_d_._o_r_g>.  It was merged
     with vviiaappmm in OpenBSD 5.0.

BBUUGGSS
     The driver doesn't support commands with a data buffer size of more than
     2 bytes.

     Interrupt support is unimplemented, as is support for setting values.

